<div class="modal fade ai-task-modal" id="aiTaskDecomposeModal" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="modal-dialog modal-xl modal-dialog-centered modal-dialog-scrollable">
        <div class="modal-content border-0">
            <div class="modal-header ai-task-modal__header border-0">
                <div class="d-flex align-items-start gap-3 min-w-0">
                    <span class="ai-task-modal__icon"><i class="bi bi-stars"></i></span>
                    <div class="min-w-0">
                        <div class="ai-task-modal__eyebrow">DeepSeek GoalPlanningAgent + RAG</div>
                        <h5 class="modal-title fw-bold mb-1">Agent lập kế hoạch có trích nguồn</h5>
                        <div class="text-muted small text-truncate" id="aiTaskSourceName"></div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Đóng AI chia task"></button>
            </div>
            <div class="modal-body ai-task-modal__body">
                <input type="hidden" id="aiTaskSourceType" />
                <input type="hidden" id="aiTaskSourceId" />
                <input type="hidden" id="aiTaskPreferredProjectId" />

                <div class="ai-task-guidance mb-3">
                    <div class="row g-3 align-items-end">
                        <div class="col-lg-8">
                            <label class="form-label small fw-semibold text-secondary">Gợi ý thêm cho AI</label>
                            <textarea id="aiTaskAdditionalContext" class="form-control" rows="2" maxlength="1000" placeholder="VD: ưu tiên trong 2 tuần tới, chia theo phòng ban sales, tránh task quá lớn..."></textarea>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-lg-4">
                            <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary w-100 d-inline-flex align-items-center justify-content-center gap-2" id="aiTaskRunBtn">
                                <i class="bi bi-magic"></i>
                                <span>Chạy agent</span>
                            </button>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div id="aiTaskAlert" class="alert d-none mb-3" role="alert"></div>

                <div id="aiTaskLoading" class="ai-task-loading d-none" aria-live="polite">
                    <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2 mb-3">
                        <span class="spinner-border spinner-border-sm text-primary" role="status" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                        <strong>Agent đang đối chiếu mục tiêu, lịch sử và nguồn được phép truy cập...</strong>
                    </div>
                    <div class="ai-task-skeleton"></div>
                    <div class="ai-task-skeleton ai-task-skeleton--short"></div>
                    <div class="ai-task-skeleton"></div>
                </div>

                <div id="aiTaskPreview" class="d-none">
                    <div id="aiTaskAgentMeta" class="alert alert-light border py-2 px-3 small mb-3" role="status"></div>
                    <div class="ai-task-target mb-3">
                        <div id="aiTaskProjectLinkHint" class="alert alert-info py-2 px-3 small mb-3 d-none" role="status"></div>
                        <div class="row g-3">
                            <div class="col-md-6">
                                <label class="form-label small fw-semibold text-secondary">WorkProject đích</label>
                                <select id="aiTaskProjectSelect" aria-label="Chọn WorkProject đích" class="form-select">
                                    <option value="">Tạo project mới</option>
                                </select>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-md-6 ai-task-new-project-field">
                                <label class="form-label small fw-semibold text-secondary">Tên project mới <span class="text-muted fw-normal">(khi tạo mới)</span></label>
                                <input type="text" id="aiTaskNewProjectName" aria-label="Tên project mới" class="form-control" maxlength="200" placeholder="Nhập khi chọn tạo project mới" />
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="ai-task-preview-toolbar">
                        <div>
                            <div class="ai-task-modal__eyebrow">Danh sách chờ duyệt</div>
                            <div id="aiTaskSummary" class="ai-task-summary">0 task sẵn sàng tạo</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="ai-task-preview-actions">
                            <label class="ai-task-select-all" for="aiTaskSelectAll">
                                <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" id="aiTaskSelectAll" checked>
                                <span>Chọn tất cả</span>
                            </label>
                            <span class="ai-task-review-pill"><i class="bi bi-pencil-square"></i> Có thể chỉnh trước khi tạo</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div id="aiTaskEmpty" class="ai-task-empty d-none">
                        <i class="bi bi-inbox"></i>
                        <span>Agent chưa đủ dữ liệu để trả về task phù hợp. Hãy bổ sung ngữ cảnh rồi chạy lại.</span>
                    </div>

                    <div id="aiTaskTableBody" class="ai-task-review-list"></div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="modal-footer ai-task-modal__footer border-0">
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-secondary" data-bs-dismiss="modal">Hủy</button>
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-danger d-none" id="aiTaskRejectBtn" disabled>
                    <i class="bi bi-x-circle me-1"></i>Không sử dụng đề xuất
                </button>
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-success d-inline-flex align-items-center gap-2" id="aiTaskConfirmBtn" disabled>
                    <i class="bi bi-check2-circle"></i>
                    <span>Xác nhận tạo task</span>
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<style>
    .ai-task-modal .modal-content {
        border-radius: 8px;
        box-shadow: 0 18px 50px rgba(13, 21, 48, 0.16);
